 "assumptions": [
  "GPU implementation (CubeCL kernels). Same butteraugli algorithm as the in-tree CPU port; multires pipeline runs full-res + half-res and supersample-adds the half-res diffmap (pipeline.rs:1313-1360), so per-plane work is 1.25x W*H.",
  "Gaussian blurs use per-sigma LUT tables (blur_lut::make_table; BLUR_SIGMAS pipeline.rs:217): sigma1.2 opsin r=2 (5 taps), sigma7.16 LF r=16 (33 taps, blur_lut.rs:447), sigma3.22 HF -> 21 taps (2*ceil(3s)+1), sigma1.56 UHF -> 11 taps, sigma2.7 mask -> 17 taps.",
  "AC diffmap: 3x malta_triple (one per channel; UHF 16-dir x 9-tap hf-pattern + HF/MF 16-dir x 5-tap lf-pattern, malta.rs:60-252) + 2x l2_asym_plus_l2 + 1x l2_write (pipeline.rs:2209-2280). Malta taps read shared-memory tiles; the (a,b) diff plane is computed during cooperative tile load (compute_diff, malta.rs:23).",
  "DC: l2_diff_write_3ch on LF bands. Mask: combine+diff_precompute -> sigma2.7 blur -> fuzzy_erosion (ref) and -> mask_to_error_mul (dist), pipeline.rs:2362-2460.",
  "Frequency separation fusions per T_x comments pipeline.rs:2013-2130: LF v-pass fuses MF=XYB-LF subtract + low_freq_to_vals mul; HF v-pass fuses 3 band splits; UHF v-pass fuses X/Y splits.",
  "GPU implementation"
 ],
